WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.353
Vinnie fought back tears.

2
00:00:06.354 --> 00:00:10.286
"How did this happen?" he cried.

3
00:00:10.287 --> 00:00:13.035
The prisoners began climbing.

4
00:00:13.036 --> 00:00:17.406
The Aztec priests were standing at the top of the pyramid.

5
00:00:17.407 --> 00:00:22.557
Vinnie’s heart beat faster with each step.

6
00:00:22.558 --> 00:00:25.484
Mandy ran toward the temple.

7
00:00:25.485 --> 00:00:28.409
"Vinnie!" she screamed.

8
00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:30.942
She could not find her brother.

9
00:00:30.943 --> 00:00:35.334
Suddenly she saw the prisoners on the temple steps.

10
00:00:35.335 --> 00:00:41.077
The last person in line looked very small and very familiar.

11
00:00:41.078 --> 00:00:46.359
"Mandy! Stop! It’s too dangerous!" Mazatl called to her.

12
00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:50.434
But Mandy kept pushing through the crowd.

13
00:00:50.435 --> 00:00:53.280
"Go back, little one!" a guard yelled.

14
00:00:53.281 --> 00:00:56.010
But Mandy was too quick.

15
00:00:56.011 --> 00:00:59.875
She ran up the stone steps.

16
00:00:59.876 --> 00:01:03.872
"Vinnie!" She grabbed her brother’s arm.

17
00:01:03.873 --> 00:01:10.079
"Mandy! What are we going to do?" Vinnie said in a shaky voice.

18
00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:12.333
"The photo, where is it?

19
00:01:12.334 --> 00:01:15.809
Maybe it can help us," she said.

20
00:01:15.810 --> 00:01:19.816
"The old man!" gasped Vinnie.

21
00:01:19.817 --> 00:01:23.476
"I remember, he was on some steps."

22
00:01:23.477 --> 00:01:25.669
Vinnie took the picture out.

23
00:01:25.670 --> 00:01:27.878
It was glowing blue.

24
00:01:27.879 --> 00:01:32.823
"We must be very close," he said.

25
00:01:32.824 --> 00:01:35.067
"What are those?"

26
00:01:35.068 --> 00:01:38.607
Mandy pointed to the glowing objects in the photo.

27
00:01:38.608 --> 00:01:42.338
She looked around. "Vinnie! Look!"

28
00:01:42.339 --> 00:01:48.364
She pointed to the bottom of the steps. Statues!

29
00:01:48.365 --> 00:01:51.475
Mandy looked at the photo again.

30
00:01:51.476 --> 00:01:55.750
"I can’t tell what they are!" she shouted.

31
00:01:55.751 --> 00:01:58.228
Vinnie peered at the photo.

32
00:01:58.229 --> 00:02:01.859
Then he looked down at the stone objects.

33
00:02:01.860 --> 00:02:07.202
"There’s only one way to find out!" he said.

34
00:02:07.203 --> 00:02:12.139
He grabbed his sister’s hand and headed back down the steps.

35
00:02:12.140 --> 00:02:15.674
The guards began running toward the children.

36
00:02:15.675 --> 00:02:18.871
The crowd below went wild.

37
00:02:18.872 --> 00:02:24.078
The drums beat louder.

38
00:02:24.079 --> 00:02:29.075
"Hang on!" Vinnie climbed onto a huge stone ramp.

39
00:02:29.076 --> 00:02:34.250
He slid all the way down. Mandy followed.

40
00:02:34.251 --> 00:02:39.289
They got to the bottom and saw that the statues were dragons.

41
00:02:39.290 --> 00:02:42.817
The photo glowed red.

42
00:02:42.818 --> 00:02:46.337
"Vinnie! Mandy!" Mazatl called.

43
00:02:46.338 --> 00:02:48.809
They looked at their new friend.

44
00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:53.226
"Thanks for everything, Mazatl!" Mandy called out.

45
00:02:53.227 --> 00:02:55.763
"Don’t worry about us."

46
00:02:55.764 --> 00:02:59.345
"We’re going home," Vinnie shouted.

47
00:02:59.346 --> 00:03:03.829
Vinnie and Mandy held hands and closed their eyes.

48
00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:09.393
The noise of the crowd faded as the children fell down the dark tunnel.

49
00:03:09.394 --> 00:03:12.221
"Ohhh!"

50
00:03:12.222 --> 00:03:16.418
Vinnie and Mandy landed safely back in the attic.

51
00:03:16.419 --> 00:03:20.839
"That was a close call," Mandy said.

52
00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:22.546
Vinnie nodded.

53
00:03:22.547 --> 00:03:25.914
"Mandy!" Mom called from below.

54
00:03:25.915 --> 00:03:27.545
"Where are you?"

55
00:03:27.546 --> 00:03:30.942
"I’m coming!" she yelled.

56
00:03:30.943 --> 00:03:34.291
She winked at Vinnie and ran downstairs.

57
00:03:34.292 --> 00:03:36.052
"What were you doing?

58
00:03:36.053 --> 00:03:38.081
We’re late!" Mom asked.

59
00:03:38.082 --> 00:03:40.474
She looked at Mandy.

60
00:03:40.475 --> 00:03:44.138
"What happened to that bracelet I bought you?"

61
00:03:44.139 --> 00:03:48.018
"Um, I left it in the attic.

62
00:03:48.019 --> 00:03:52.212
Come on, Mom, let’s go!"

63
00:03:52.213 --> 00:03:54.608
Vinnie looked out the window.

64
00:03:54.609 --> 00:03:58.480
His dad was looking up while mowing the lawn.

65
00:03:58.481 --> 00:04:02.409
"Vinnie, come and help me!" he shouted.

66
00:04:02.410 --> 00:04:05.140
Vinnie smiled and waved.

67
00:04:05.141 --> 00:04:08.667
"Okay, Dad! I’ll be right there."

68
00:04:08.668 --> 00:04:19.258
After his close call with the Aztecs, mowing the lawn didn’t seem that bad.

